\description{
Game info of one match: state, arena, attendance, officials, coaches, period scores.

Wraps \verb{GET https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/eihl.hokejovyzapis.cz/matches/\{match_id\}/game-info.json} of the EIHL eSports bucket. Example: \url{https://s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/eihl.hokejovyzapis.cz/matches/4440/game-info.json}.
Seasons are END years (2027 = 2026/27); every request waits at least one second after
the last one to the same host.
